  <name>BridgeMix</name>
  <summary>Unofficial controller for the Roland BRIDGE CAST mixer</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.ex0danify">
    <name>Ex0danify</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      BridgeMix is an open-source controller for the Roland BRIDGE CAST USB audio mixer. Roland's own app has
      no Linux version, so BridgeMix talks to the device over MIDI directly.
    </p>
    <p>
      Control the mixes, microphone effects, voice changer, game effects, output routing and profiles, with live level
      metering. A plugin system and an optional local REST API let other tools such as OBS or a Stream Deck drive the mixer.
    </p>
    <p>This is an unofficial project and is not affiliated with Roland.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.ex0danify.BridgeMix.desktop</launchable>
